# DRAW keymap preset: DeluxePaint (classic)  (SAFEST — DRAW-free target keys only)
#
# Format: actionId keycode requireMods forbidMods [device button]
#   mods bits: 1=Ctrl 2=Shift 4=Alt.  Action ids: GUI/COMMAND.BM (CMD_init) / SHORTCUTS.md.
# Policy (Rick, "safest"): applied ONLY if the target key is UNBOUND in DRAW. Collisions
# are documented, not applied — decide them in PLANS/PRESETS-KEYMAP-DECISIONS.md.
#
# DeluxePaint (Amiga/DOS) is the ancestor of this whole genre; its shortcuts are
# historic and often single-key with no modifier. Many map to DRAW tools already.

# --- Safe remaps (target key free in DRAW: Ctrl+I/J/K/U/W) ---
# DeluxePaint predates Ctrl-combo conventions; no provably-safe free-key op. (none)

# --- COLLISIONS (need a decision; NOT applied) -------------------------------
#   d   Dotted freehand     -> DRAW D is Dot (partial match)
#   b   Continuous freehand -> DRAW B is Brush (match)
#   v   Straight line       -> DRAW L is Line (v is Move in DRAW)
#   r   Rectangle           -> DRAW R is Rectangle (match)
#   c   Circle              -> DRAW C is Ellipse (match)
#   o   Filled ellipse      -> DRAW O is Bevel-rect style
#   f   Fill                -> DRAW F is Fill (match)
#   t   Text                -> DRAW T is Text (match)
#   , / .   pick FG/BG      -> DRAW uses Alt+Click / picker (I)
#   DeluxePaint agrees with DRAW on B/R/C/F/T — no rows needed for those.
